  "index_test": "whole-animal-in-vivo",
  "index_test_evidence": "To this end, we investigated translation of HR and BP endpoints using data from 83 compounds that were tested in telemetry studies in rat and large animal (LA; dog or monkey) and 79 compounds that were tested in LA telemetry studies and human phase I clinical trials.",
  "decision": "include",
  "reason": "The study reports quantitative measures of agreement (sensitivity, specificity, predictive values) between whole-animal in vivo cardiovascular safety pharmacology studies in rats and large animals, and human clinical trials. This directly addresses the concordance between animal models and human clinical results."
